OL,3,GNEWSACare worker stole wedding ring to
OL,4,Abuy presents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former care worker who stole an
OL,7,Felderly woman's wedding ring and sold
OL,8,Fit to pay for Christmas presents has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FAmy Bassett, 33, of St George's Road in
OL,12,FKeynsham, targeted "exceptionally
OL,13,Fvulnerable" elderly women in her care
OL,14,Ffrom January to December 2024, Avon and
OL,15,FSomerset Police said.
