OL,3,GNEWSACare worker stole wedding ring to
OL,4,Abuy presents
OL,5,
OL,6,FBassett stole both the wedding and
OL,7,Fengagement rings of one woman with
OL,8,Fdementia who was a resident at a care
OL,9,Fhome in Bath and North East Somerset,
OL,10,Fpolice said. She removed the rings
OL,11,Fwithout the woman's consent and sold
OL,12,Fthem to a pawnbroker.
OL,14,FBassett was jailed for four years and
OL,15,Ffour months at Bristol Crown Court on 6
OL,16,FNovember after she admitted dwelling
OL,17,Ftheft and fraud by false
OL,18,Frepresentation.
